      "content": "it’s hard to just \"keep trying\" when every time I try, I just find new ways to fail them. it feels less like a mistake and more like a fundamental flaw. sometimes i look at our family portraits and i just think... if i wasn't part of the picture, everything would look so much better. the legacy would stay untarnished. it would just be pure.",
